<title>FRANCE: Navigation Mixte sells Via Bourse - paper.</title>
<headline>Navigation Mixte sells Via Bourse - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie de Navigation Mixte, a unit of Paribas, has sold its brokerage unit Via Bourse to the Luxembourg holding Incavalor SA, French newspaper le Figaro reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Incavalor already has investment management companies in Switzerland, Britain and France where it owns International Capital Gestion.</p>
<p>To buy Via Bourse, Incavalor created a holding company, International Capital Holding, Le Figaro said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452 nim/pmc</p>
